message: >-
  If you use this workflow or its notebooks, please cite it using the details
  below.
title: "The Connected River"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gouldsbrough
    given-names: Lily
    affiliation: "UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  The Connected River is a reusable workflow for bringing together monitoring
  data collected at different points along the river network and through time.
  It includes an adaptable matching recipe and an England-wide example.
keywords:
  - river health
  - environmental data
  - data integration
  - river-network matching
  - reproducible research
